    distractors: 2-8 per grid, sizes 1x1 to 3x2, scattered; must NOT be on clear line-of-sight from any socket through opening
    total: 5-11
  output_rule: |
    Each matched red slides from opening side into socket, docking below/beside teeth block.
    Trail (black) painted over all intermediate positions. Unmatched reds erased to bg.
  trail:
